# Product standard

Mostawdaee is being built as a **global, competitive, premium, practical, trusted and certifiable** warehouse/POS product. Treat every change as if it will ship to paying merchants.

## Do

- Prefer quiet, accurate UI over banners, fake urgency, or decorative noise in navigation.
- Keep money, stock, payroll, debts and subscriptions **correct and verifiable**. Never invent numbers, mock paid unlocks, or hide overdrafts.
- Separate currencies. Format amounts in their own currency. Do not swap symbols without converting.
- Fail closed on paid or privileged actions: subscriptions, vault withdrawals, stock reductions, payroll.
- Put commercial actions (upgrade, renew, billing) in Settings or the expired-subscription lock — not in the sidebar.
- After UI changes, verify the real user path (click/navigate), not just a screenshot.

## Do not

- Add fake Google Pay / card forms, simulated purchase tokens, or client-side premium flags.
- Leave dead buttons that look like they charge money.
- Re-introduce sidebar upgrade cards, random invoice numbers, or second Supabase clients.
